## **8. Register student permission**

Staff should be able to create a student record manually when authorized.

The permission must be separate from student profile viewing.

| Permission                     | Access                          |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |
| `student.profile.view`         | View directory                  |
| `student.profile.view.details` | View full profile               |
| `student.registration.create`  | Create student record           |
| `student.registration.edit`    | Edit permitted fields           |
| `student.registration.approve` | Approve registration            |
| `student.status.manage`        | Change student status           |
| `student.document.view`        | View student documents          |
| `student.document.upload`      | Upload documents                |
| `student.document.verify`      | Verify documents                |
| `student.attendance.view`      | View attendance                 |
| `student.academic.view`        | View academic history           |
| `student.finance.summary.view` | View authorized finance summary |
| `student.export`               | Export student records          |

Sensitive access

Financial balances, medical records, disciplinary records, counselling records, biometric data and identity documents should not be automatically included in the student profile response. Access should be separately authorized and logged.

