## **11. Admissions statuses**

| Status             | Meaning                |
| ------------------ | ---------------------- |
| DRAFT              | Application started    |
| SUBMITTED          | Application submitted  |
| UNDER_REVIEW       | Admissions review      |
| DOCUMENTS_REQUIRED | Missing documents      |
| APPROVED           | Approved for admission |
| OFFER_SENT         | Offer issued           |
| OFFER_ACCEPTED     | Offer accepted         |
| REJECTED           | Rejected               |
| WITHDRAWN          | Withdrawn              |
| REGISTERED         | Registered student     |

## **12. Admissions menu**

The admissions officer's menu should include:

- Admissions Dashboard
