## **18. Admissions permissions**

| Permission                     | Function                                |
| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
| `admission.view`               | View admissions                         |
| `admission.application.create` | Create application                      |
| `admission.application.edit`   | Edit permitted fields                   |
| `admission.application.review` | Review application                      |
| `admission.document.view`      | View submitted documents                |
| `admission.document.verify`    | Verify documents                        |
| `admission.approve`            | Approve applicants                      |
| `admission.reject`             | Reject applicants                       |
| `admission.offer.create`       | Issue offer                             |
| `admission.offer.manage`       | Manage offer status                     |
| `student.registration.create`  | Convert approved applicant into student |
| `student.registration.approve` | Approve student registration            |
| `admission.report.view`        | View admissions reports                 |
| `admission.export`             | Export permitted admissions data        |

Approval separation

The system should support separation of duties. For example, application review, admission approval, student registration and financial clearance may be assigned to different officers according to the college policy. Approval permissions should not be automatically granted to all admission staff.

